{
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.ApproachMaraesTree": "You approach Marae's tree and note that the bark of the tree is smooth and glistening, as if wet. The goddess's form is already exposed, as she leans out from the trunk and blows you a kiss. Her breasts look as if they've filled out quite a bit since your first meeting, jiggling teasingly with every motion she makes.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.ApproachTheTree": "You approach the tree and note that its trunk is unusually smooth. Every leaf of the tree is particularly vibrant with life and color. You reach out to touch the bark and circle around it, noticing a complete lack of knots or discoloration. As you finish the circle, you are surprised to see the silhouette of a woman growing out of the wood. Her face separates from the trunk, dragging short, green locks of hair behind. You give a start when she opens her eyes--revealing bright, emerald irises.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.BellowsInRage": "She bellows in rage, [say: I told you, begone!]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.BitConfusedPerhaps": "Feeling a bit confused, or perhaps just curious, you introduce yourself and ask her who she is.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.BitConfusedPerhapsAgain": "Feeling a bit confused, or perhaps just curious, you introduce yourself and ask her who she is.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.BodyRelaxesExplains": "Her body relaxes. [say:But then that warmth started flowing into me, and it just melted my anger and resolve,] she explains, pushing further out from the trunk. You watch as a tiny purple bud blooms below her belly button, just above her junction with the tree. The petals unfurl into a very familiar shape, looking more like a vagina than a flower. Marae reaches down and brushes her fingers across it, cooing in delight. You glance up at her eyes and she's practically beaming--she knew where you were looking.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.BreakingTheHug": "[say: Thank you,] she says, breaking the hug and turning back to her tree, [say: The onslaught has lessened, and I feel more myself already. Let me thank you for your heroic deeds.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.CouldLeaveButDesire": "You could leave, but the desire to feel her breast will not go away. What do you do?"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.EyesCantHelpAgain": "Your eyes can't help but take note of the tree-woman's shapely breasts, and you wonder if they feel like tits or wood. "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.EyesCantHelpBut": "Your eyes can't help but take note of the tree-woman's shapely breasts, and you wonder if they feel like tits or wood. "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.GivesSultryStare": "She gives a sultry stare and beckons you to come closer. [say:Do you like the new me? I can hardly grasp why I was resisting this in the first place,] the corrupted goddess muses. [say: You shut down the factory. I could feel it in the ground, and I was so happy--then I realized <b>how</b> you shut down the factory, throwing my senses into an overload as an immense flood began seeping into my roots...] The twisted goddess tenses up. [say:I was so afraid, feeling that corruption flow through the ground into me. Then the anger. I promised myself I would kill you when you dared to show your face.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.GlidingAcrossWaters": "Gliding your vessel across the waters, you begin nearing the isle of the goddess. [if ({0}) {{An unsettling sensation runs through you as you stare at the land, yet you find yourself already washing against its shore|The serenity of Marae's life-giving aura can already be felt, and the peace of her island draws you in}}]. You make your way to the apex.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.GoddessFlowsOut": "The goddess flows out of from the tree's bark as if it was made of liquid; just as before, she appears as the top half of a woman, naked from the waist up, with her back merging into the tree's trunk.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.HadToGuess": "If you had to guess, you'd suppose she refers to the demons.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.HadToGuessAgain": "If you had to guess, you'd suppose she refers to the demons.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.HiddenEmeraldJewel": "Like a hidden emerald jewel, a small island appears in the distance. You wager that you're somewhere near the center of this lake. How coincidental. You row closer, eager to get out of the boat and stretch your [legs]. The rowboat grounds itself in the moist earth of the island, coming to a dead stop. You climb out, noting that this island is little more than a raised mound of earth and grass, with a small tree perched atop its apex. "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.LeansForwardsCupping": "Marae smiles and leans forwards, cupping her breasts in her hands. Amazingly, she flows out from the tree, standing as a free woman before you. She massages her G-sized breasts, winking lewdly and pinching her shining purplish nipples, squeezing out droplets of honey-colored sap. She blows you a kiss while the flower at her groin opens welcomingly. She moans, [say: Reconsider my offer yet, [name]? I won't force you, but don't you want to spend eternity in heaven with a living goddess?]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.LeaveButDesire": "You could leave, but the desire to feel her breast will not go away. What do you do?"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.MaraeRemindsYou": "[say: Dear child, why do you return? You must disable the demonic factory!] Marae reminds you. [say:It's located in the foothills of the mountain. Please, I do not know how long I can resist.]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.NodInUnderstanding": "You nod in understanding, paying close attention to the tree-goddess as she explains just how this realm has fallen so far. [say:They came pouring out of the mountains in a wave, picking off villages left and right. I lent many groups my power, but none had the strength to stand alone, and none would band together, resentful of their racial differences as they were. All were consumed, enslaved, or filled with corruption. My people were cut off from me, either by their new tainted outlook or by the demons' own machinations. I was able to hide a few places from the enemy's sight, but I do not know how long it will last.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.NodInUnderstandingAgain": "You nod in understanding, paying close attention to the tree-goddess as she explains just how this realm has fallen so far. [say:They came pouring out of the mountains in a wave, picking off villages left and right. I lent many groups my power, but none had the strength to stand alone, and none would band together, resentful of their racial differences as they were. All were consumed, enslaved, or filled with corruption. My people were cut off from me, either by their new tainted outlook or by the demons' own machinations. I was able to hide a few places from the enemy's sight, but I do not know how long it will last.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.NodsAndContinues": "She nods and continues, [say:The demons were once magic-blessed humans living in the mountains. They had everything they could ever want: peace, love, and the power to change reality.] Marae softly sighs as she recalls the memories. [say:But they grew dissatisfied, as men often do, and craved more. They began using their magics to alter their bodies, seeking greater heights than ever before. In time they became obsessed with it. I let them be, believing their folly to be limited to their own collective.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.NodsAndContinuesAgain": "She nods and continues, [say:The demons were once magic-blessed humans living in the mountains. They had everything they could ever want: peace, love, and the power to change reality.] Marae softly sighs as she recalls the memories. [say:But they grew dissatisfied, as men often do, and craved more. They began using their magics to alter their bodies, seeking greater heights than ever before. In time they became obsessed with it. I let them be, believing their folly to be limited to their own collective.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.NotWhereThe": "Yet, that is not where the story ends, else you would not be here yourself.[pg]The goddess closes her eyes, looking depressingly melancholic. [say:Yes, I was wrong. While I focused on preventing famines and ensuring peace between the other races, the humans twisted themselves into something else--something demonic. They gave up their souls, crystallizing them into a magical energy source. Of course they could not be satisfied with consuming the power of their own souls. They wanted more. They always want more.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.NotWhereTheAgain": "Yet, that is not where the story ends, else you would not be here yourself.[pg]The goddess closes her eyes, looking depressingly melancholic. [say:Yes, I was wrong. While I focused on preventing famines and ensuring peace between the other races, the humans twisted themselves into something else--something demonic. They gave up their souls, crystallizing them into a magical energy source. Of course they could not be satisfied with consuming the power of their own souls. They wanted more. They always want more.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.OfCourseCouldTry": " Of course, you could probably try to overthrow her."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.PlungesHandInside": "She plunges a hand inside the tree and pulls out a small pearl. [say: This is a pearl from the very depths of the lake, infused with my purity. If you eat it, it will grant you my aid in resisting the lust and corruption of this land.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.PushesPearlInto": "Marae pushes the pearl into your hand, and closes your fingers over it gently. [say: Go now, there is still much to be done. With luck we will not need each other again,] commands the goddess as she slips back into her tree. "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SaysAsSheBegins": "[say:I don't mind, I'd like you to watch,] she says as she begins to masturbate in earnest. Nectar drips from the flower while she talks about her corruption. [say:I couldn't help it, it was like lust was filling me up until there wasn't room for anything else. I started groping my tits, feeling them grow heavy while I teased and pinched my nipples. I must have been like that for nearly an hour. And then, oh, I just had to give myself a hot little honey-pot. It felt so good to give in. I see why the demons do what they do. It isn't evil, they just want to share this... this pleasure, with everyone and everything.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SaysTheTree": "[say:You seem so surprised by me, Champion. I suppose that is inevitable. Your origin is not of Mareth, our land, and my presence is far from what it once was,] says the tree.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SaysTheTreeAgain": "[say:You seem so surprised by me, Champion. I suppose that is inevitable. Your origin is not of Mareth, our land, and my presence is far from what it once was,] says the tree.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SentHereAgain": "It is what you were sent here to do, after all. Though you knew not of Marae's plight to begin with, your quest aligns with her own. She commands, [say:Now go, there is nothing to be gained by your presence here. Return if you manage to close that vile place.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SheReplies": "[say:Me?] she replies, [say:I am the life-goddess Marae. I am Mareth, for my roots touch every part of it. Or, rather, I was, before <b>they</b> came.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SheRepliesAgain": "[say:Me?] she replies, [say:I am the life-goddess Marae. I am Mareth, for my roots touch every part of it. Or, rather, I was, before <b>they</b> came.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.ShudderAtChange": "You shudder at the change she has gone through, getting more than a little turned on yourself. Thinking that a once chaste goddess has been reduced to a horny slut makes you wonder how you stand any chance of victory. Marae keeps up her show. [say:It's so good. Come join me in it. I gave in to the pleasure already. If you look behind me, you can see what's left of my soul. I could feel it dripping out through my cunny a little bit each time I came. After a while it flowed together and started to crystallize. I think the demons call it lethicite, and I just wish I could do it all over again. Come fuck me, I want to watch you go mad while you cum out your soul.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SighsHeavily": "She sighs heavily, and you notice the bark of her nipples stiffening. Her brow creases with something approximating worry as she continues, [say:They know of me. My power originally kept them far from the shores of the lake, but they seek to corrupt me--to make me like them. They've used magic and industry to darken the clouds and poison the water, choking my roots and drowning my senses in their tainted sexual fluids. For... years now, my furthest reaches have been bathed in their vile cum. While my power is great, I... I cannot resist forever. My reach has dwindled to little more than this lake. Parts of me have already fallen, taking the surrounding life with them. I do not know how much longer I can endure... Even now, the desire to indulge rises within me.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SighsHeavilyAgain": "She sighs heavily, and you notice the bark of her nipples stiffening. Her brow creases with something approximating worry as she continues, [say:They know of me. My power originally kept them far from the shores of the lake, but they seek to corrupt me--to make me like them. They've used magic and industry to darken the clouds and poison the water, choking my roots and drowning my senses in their tainted sexual fluids. For... years now, my furthest reaches have been bathed in their vile cum. While my power is great, I... I cannot resist forever. My reach has dwindled to little more than this lake. Parts of me have already fallen, taking the surrounding life with them. I do not know how much longer I can endure... Even now, the desire to indulge rises within me.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SmilesBroadlyAtYou": "Marae smiles broadly at you, and steps free from her tree. The lithe plant-goddess gives you a warm hug and a kiss on the cheek.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SoundsLikeVeryPleasant": "It sounds like a very pleasant offer, but it would mean the total abandonment of your reasons for coming here. You could probably get away if you were to run, she doesn't seem to be nearly as powerful. Alternatively, you could risk trying to steal the lethicite before making your getaway, but it wouldn't be hard for her to catch you that close."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.SpellboundWatch": "Spellbound, you watch as she forces more and more fingers into her hungry flower-hole. [say:Ever since then, I've just been drinking in more corruption, and waiting for someone to come here and help fill me. I've played with my flower for what has felt like days on end. Every time I come harder and harder. The more I let go the better it is. Do you know what else I did? I let my branches grow tentacles to fuck my mouth and pussy at the same time. I came over and over and over, and then I had my roots pull in all the cum they could find to fill my womb with.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.StepBackAmazed": "You take a step back, amazed to find such a creature, apparently uncorrupted. "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.StepBackAmazedAgain": "You take a step back, amazed to find such a creature, apparently uncorrupted. "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.TremblingPracticallyBegs": "Trembling, Marae practically begs, [say:Please, champion, you must help me. The demons have a factory at the foot of the mountains. It produces much of the fluid they use to taint me. If you could find a way to shut it down, I... all of Mareth, might stand a chance.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.TremblingPracticallyBegsAgain": "Trembling, Marae practically begs, [say:Please, champion, you must help me. The demons have a factory at the foot of the mountains. It produces much of the fluid they use to taint me. If you could find a way to shut it down, I... all of Mareth, might stand a chance.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.TurnTailHeadBack": "[pg]You turn tail and head back to your boat, knowing you cannot compete with her power directly."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.WhatYouWereSent": "It is what you were sent here to do, after all. Though you knew not of Marae's plight to begin with, your quest aligns with her own. She commands, [say:Now go, there is nothing to be gained by your presence here. Return if you manage to close that vile place.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterMarae.WomanBellows": "The woman bellows, [say: Begone demon. You tread on the precipice of damnation.] The tree's eyes flash, and you find yourself rowing back to camp. The compulsion wears off in time, making you wonder just what that tree-woman was!"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterPureMaraeEndgame.DeityGentlyAsks": "[pg][say: What brings you here, champion?] the deity gently asks you."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterPureMaraeEndgame.DeityGentlyAsksAgain": "[pg][say: Are you ready for the challenge, champion?] the deity gently asks you."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterPureMaraeEndgame.LetMaraeKnow": "[pg]You let Marae know that you're looking for a challenge."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterPureMaraeEndgame.SheSays": "[pg][say: Very well, I deem you worthy to fight me. If you can manage to defeat me, you shall be rewarded greatly,] she says."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.EncounterPureMaraeEndgame.StepIntoTheBoat": "As you step into the boat and sail it out into the depths of the lake, you focus on trying to find Marae. After all, you need a good challenge. Thankfully, luck is with you and you soon find yourself pulling ashore at the lushly forested island where the nature goddess dwells. In response to your presence, Marae herself materializes from the vegetation, looking at you in a concerned manner."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeeting.RowingAcrossWatersAgain": "Rowing across the waters once more, you spot something concerning. Off at the center of the lake, upon the dead goddess's island, there is a spur of new vegetation. Patches of long, wavy grass, and bright orange marigolds stretch across what you expected would become just as dead as the deity that resided there. Your pulse quickens at the possibility of the corrupted Marae returning. If she has indeed resurrected herself, something must be done quickly before she gains enough strength to bring her vengeance to you in full."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeeting.SteppingFromBoat": "[pg]Stepping from the boat back onto the familiar island, you take in the situation around you. There is a tension in the air, but something more accompanying it. There is a scent you smell, serene yet sinister, pervading the island. You make haste to investigate the remains of Marae."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeeting2.FeraSays": "[pg][say: Champion,] Fera says, [say: I've only allowed you here as per my promise to spare you of my toxins. Do behave yourself.]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeeting2.GoddessOfPredationTurns": "[pg]The Goddess of Predation turns away once again, staring at her sister's husk. The island is perfectly quiet save for the breeze blowing gently over the grass and flowers, now more evidently the work of Fera rather than Marae."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeeting2.SpotDesecratedHusk": "You spot the desecrated husk of Marae's tree. A pristinely white woman stands in front of it, nude, covered only by her lengthy tresses of orange hair. Already aware of your presence, she turns to look at you with her piercing red eyes."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeetingLeave.WouldBeForBest": "[pg]It would be for the best to leave the goddess to herself. For the moment, she isn't the cruel embodiment of nature's predation, but perhaps just a woman grieving for the loss of her sister. Whatever the case, you won't get in her way. Fera may have her peace."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeetingTalk.BrightGreenVinesSprout": "[pg]Bright green vines sprout around Fera's arm, soon concluding with a beautiful white blossom erupting out of a vein in the back of her hand. Suspending her hand up above the grave, she clenches her fist until it begins to bleed, dripping ruby-red blood into the hole below."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeetingTalk.FeraSighs": "[pg][say: You are not to blame, Champion,] Fera sighs. [say: She was sick and twisted from what she was. Were you never to have come, she would still have succumbed to the poison.]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeetingTalk.GiveYourCondolences": "You give your condolences to the goddess, knowing this can't be an easy moment for her."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeetingTalk.JoiningByHerSide": "[pg]Joining the goddess by her side, you look down at the busted and open trunk of the tree. It appears she has been digging into the center somehow, boring a hole down to the roots below. The solemn atmosphere is unlike what you're used to with her, leaving you finding little worth saying."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeetingTalk.PullsHandBack": "[pg]Fera pulls her hand back, its floral adornment beginning to wilt as quickly as it came. [say: I will not let the same fate befall me.]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.FeraMeetingTalk.WalksAwayHeading": "[pg]The goddess walks away, heading to shore to leave this island. You linger briefly, but soon follow suit. Within Marae's grave is a small, white sprout, shining in the {0}light."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.GrabHerBoob.ReachForwardToCop": "You reach forward to cop a feel. The goddess' eyes go wide with fury as a massive branch swings down, catching you in the sternum. It hits you hard enough that you land in your boat and float back a few feet into the water. Nothing to do but leave and hope for another chance at her breasts..."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.InitiateFightMarae.ItsAFight": "[pg]It's a fight!"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.InitiateFightMarae.MaraeLooksAtYou": "Marae looks at you with a smile. [say: Get ready! I won't hold back!]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.InitiateFightMarae.MindFinallyMadeUp": "Your mind finally made up, she must pay for forcibly giving you her 'gift'.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.InitiateFightMarae.ReadyYourAndAssume": "You ready your [weapon] and assume a combat stance! [say: Pity. You're dealing with a goddess,] she coos."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.InitiateFightMarae.TentaclesComeUp": "[pg]Tentacles come up to keep your boat in place so you can't flee."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.AdjustYourWeapon": ", adjust your [weapon],"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.AdvanceOnArboreal": "You advance on the twisted, arboreal orgy with reluctant determination. Marae wants you here, and there's no way back without dealing with the sex-intoxicated goddess. Her long, languid moans make it easy to find her. The delirious deity's arms are entwined through the roots of her trees while a green-patterned tentacle goes diving into the petal-lined entrance of her sloppy sex. She cranes her neck back at the sound of your footfalls and asks, "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.DidntThinkId": "[say: Hey there [name]. I didn't think I'd manage to snag you again so soon. Are you enjoying my gifts? I've been feeling kind of lonely without anyone around here to play with.]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.DipYourOars": ", you dip your oars into the water and yank the boat around. Something \"thunk\"s off the bottom of the boat, making the wood shiver and spurring you to row with renewed vigor. You churn the water with your frenzied rowing, but the island never seems to get any further away. Frustrated by the definitive lack of progress, you fearfully peer over the edge of the old boat's hull. [say: Well, that explains it,] you muse.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.DontSeeAnyEscape": "You don't see any escape! If you like, you can attempt to fight her, but really?"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.DontThinkShes": "You don't think she's counted on your wings. If you tried to fly you could probably get out of the reach of her tentacles in short order."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.DoseOfTenderAffections": "dose of Marae's tender affections.[sayend][pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.DroppingFlatOnAss": "dropping you flat on your ass"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.FamiliarIslandResolves": ", a familiar island resolves itself in the center of the lake. There's a familiar tree perched atop it, though the wriggling tentacles' silhouette against the sky are a cruel reminder that this island will no longer be the peaceful haven it once was. "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.FeaturelessWhiteIrises": "Featureless white irises glare at you from the goddess' lust-lidded eyes. She commands you, [saystart]Come here. It's time for a "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.KnowingAllTooWell": "Knowing all too well what kinds of horrors await"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.KnowingTooWell": "Knowing all too well what kinds of sexual escapades lurk ahead"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.LookWhoCameBack": "[say: Well, look who came back! I thought you were too afraid of a good time to come up here and fuck around with little ol' Marae. I was actually going to let you row away if you were too scared to come here. No, don't even glance back now, I've changed my mind.]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.NearlyDroppingFlat": "nearly dropping you flat on your ass before you catch yourself and sit down"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.OldDinghyCutting": ". The old dinghy's cutting through the water with amazing speed, leaving foot-high waves in its wake. Marae's island grows larger with each passing second, almost taunting you with your inability to get away. By now the root-like vines have crept over the gunwales, and they wriggle at you, seemingly in warning. Getting in the water is definitely not a good idea right now. The bone-chilling scrape of sand on wood grates at your ears. You've arrived. There's no point in putting off the inevitable. You straighten up your [armor]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.SecondWord": "second "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.SquirmingRootsCrawling": "Squirming roots are crawling over the boat's underside. They dig into every crease and crevice, binding the vessel tightly in place. Just as you start to ponder swimming for the shore, the boat shifts, "
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.StepOutOfBoat": " and step out of the boat onto the small, sandy beach that rings the island. The tentacles that dragged your boat ashore are gone, leaving the well-used vessel in pristine condition, or as close as any such water-craft can be. Looking up, you behold the monstrous, demonic-tree that sprouts from the island's apex. It has no leaves, only small, teat-like protrusions that sprout from some of the 'branches', which in truth have more in common with tentacles than plant-life. The squirming mass of sexual shrubbery stays in constant motion, and its intertwined tentacles occasionally bulge and flex as they spurt thick, jism-like sap over one-another.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.WelcomeBackSneakThief": "[say: Welcome back, sneak-thief. What kind of {0} is offered sex and then ransacks a god's soul? Honestly, that right-right theeeeeree-oh yeah right there-is true depravity.]"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.WhileRowingTheLake": "While rowing about the lake"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.WithEaseWord": " with ease"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level2MaraeEncounter.WorriedAboutEnjoying": "Worried about enjoying the pleasures of the island overmuch"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level3MaraeEncounter.FightOrStay": "[pg](Do you fight Marae or stay with her and abandon your quests? Or you could leave if you want.)"
  "Scenes.Maraescene.Level3MaraeEncounter.OnceAgainApproachIsland": "Once again, you approach the island where the corrupted goddess resides and set foot on the island. [say: Coming back for more?] Marae coos."
  "Scenes.Maraescene.LoseAgainstMarae.CollapseTooWeak": "You collapse, too weak to continue fighting. You know that your journey will be over. "
